  "content_en": "Dahan Yanhua Ⅱ Mengdie [First update on the 30th of the year] In the spring of 2001, I fell ill and was recuperating at home. I heard the heavy sound of smiling and opening the door of my house. Wan'er lost his temper and said, \"Who does he think he is? He asked us to complete such a big case in two and a half days.\" I sighed, knowing that he was angry with the new manager again, so I asked him, \"What about himself?\" Wan'er was discouraged, \"That man is simply not a human being. He is usually leisurely and leisurely. Drinking coffee and talking on the phone again, no matter how much work is put into his hands, he can always get it done. \"If he can do it, why can't you?\" I advised my brother, \"Put on more energy and work hard.\" After he recovered, the young doctor with glasses asked me politely. Are there any other symptoms?\" \"Okay.\" I said, but when I stood up to leave, I suddenly hesitated and walked back to ask him, \"Doctor, if you have a continuous dream, is it a disease?\" \"Dream?\" The doctor pushed up his glasses and said with a smile, \"This is not my specialty. However, in a psychological sense, every kind of dream reflects its meaning in life. The academic community has never heard of this kind of continuous dream like what Miss Zhang said. I may interpret it as a mirror image of the past and present life. \"I got up and left with a bang. Past and present lives. Does he still want to say that the situation in the dream is my previous life? What a ridiculous joke. I kicked the pebbles and walked on the road. I took out my mobile phone and called Luo Mi, \"Mimi, can you come out and accompany me?\" \"Okay.\" Luo Mi's smile on the mobile phone also showed a kind of beauty. She said, \"I want to eat your brother's chicken, rice and sprouts.\" Luo Mi ate it full of praise, and smiled and said, \"What is this? Yanran was very picky when she was young. At that time, our parents just After she passed away, I was clumsy and couldn't cook well. However, Yanran was very sensible and never complained. It just made me sad to see her. She worked hard to learn how to cook.\" \"Wow.\" Luo Mi was stunned and said after a long time, \"You are a good brother.\" I can't remember how many dreams I have had. Under the long guard of ceremony, a big man with thick eyebrows and big eyes wearing an imperial crown entered Handan City. Yan's father led the crowd to kneel down, looking respectful. The emperor cursed loudly, but he just didn't dare to resist. Manhua hurried out and knelt down to plead for her husband. At night, the emperor hugged A Yan. Yan smiled in his arms, took a look at his beard, felt it was funny, stretched out his hand, and pulled it. The emperor laughed loudly. The dream came to an abrupt end. When I woke up from the dream, Romi was about to go out. I got up, opened the bedroom window, and saw the smiling person downstairs. Closing the window, I told myself, this was fine. I felt a little sour in my heart. I think I have a little bit of exclusive desire for the people I like. I like Wan'er, I like Luo Mi, Wan'er is my closest brother, and Luo Mi is my best friend. I'm afraid that someone will come out of the depths of unknown destiny and take away Wan'er or Luo Mi. Even though they will still be my brothers and friends in the future, they will always become more distant. I haven't thought about how to face the current situation. My dearest brother and my best friend came together. Can only wish. Luo Mi, who was in love, was more charming and beautiful than before, and Er, who was in love, was always smiling. He would even say, \"Actually, if you think about it, Manager Liu is not bad, he is capable and filial, and he is handsome and pleasing to the eye.\" We were already in our junior year at that time. The dream about the girl with the same name as me visits me occasionally, sometimes a few days, sometimes a few months. She stays with me for a long time, and I gradually develop feelings for her, watching her carefree growth in the tall buildings and pavilions, with rich clothes and fine food, and a prosperous family. She in the dream and me in the dream are both happy. When the autumn wind blew the yellow leaves, Luo Mi began to feel moody and looked haggard. She said blankly, \"Yanran, maybe I am wrong. Falling in love is not just about two good people coming together.\" The autumn rain fell, not only the weather but also the mood became cold. When I got home, I pushed open the closed door of Wan'er and saw Wan'er standing at the window smoking. For so many years, Wan'er would only smoke when she was worried. Wan'er turned around and said to me, \"Welcome back, Yanran.\" The profile of her face was thin, and her cheekbones were visible. I suddenly wanted to cry. There are always some people in this world. When they are in pain, you feel more pain than them. Wan'er is the one for me. In some sense, family affection is ten times more important than friendship and a hundred times more important than love. We are dependent on each other growing on the same treeThe branches look at each other and depend on each other. I got into a unilateral cold war with Luo Mi. I couldn't forgive someone for hurting Wan'er, even if that person was Luo Mi. Although if it weren't Wan'er who was injured, I wouldn't allow anyone to hurt Luo Mi. There are very few people in this world that I really care about, so I value every one of them. Luo Mi carefully tried to please me, and she said, \"Yanran, can we really not go back to the past?\" I don't know, and I miss the past very much, the past that was pure and without impurities. That day, I came down from upstairs and saw Smile. Wan'er said, \"Girl, let's talk.\" Wan'er took me for a drive and he said, \"You clearly know that Luo Mi is not wrong.\" \"——We just want stability and peace, but Luo Mi likes to pursue an adventurous and exciting life. What she wants is someone who can shock her, but I can't do that. It's that simple. A relationship, even if The ending is not good, the feelings I have invested are all true, otherwise, when it ends, I will not be sad.\" He finally sighed softly, \"Yanran, I don't know who will make you sad in the future.\" I stayed outside for a long time before returning to the dormitory. Luo Mi looked at me cautiously, and I suddenly reached out and flicked her nose, and said brightly, \"Why, I won't eat you.\" Luo Mi cheered, her eyes bright. She solemnly handed me a book. I asked her inexplicably, \"What are you doing?\" When I opened the thread-bound page, it turned out to be Ban Gu's \"Han Shu\". Luo Mi said, \"I thought of a person.\" She opened the Han Dynasty Book and turned to \"Biography of Wife's Relatives\" and said, \"Look here.\" I followed her finger and read the line of words. \"Queen Xiaohui Zhang Yan... Xuanping Marquis Ao's daughter, mother is Princess Lu Yuan... Gaozu died, Emperor Hui came to the throne, Empress Dowager Lu wanted to be a close relative, and made the princess's daughter the emperor's queen, hoping that she would have thousands of children, but ended up without any children... After the death of Emperor Xiaohui, the world was not long settled, and the successor I don’t know. So the queen mother Lu died, and the ministers killed the Lu family. Empress Xiaohui was left alone and was buried in the Beigong. In the first year of her life, she was buried in the Anling Mausoleum. \"I stood there quietly, motionless. \"From the pre-Qin Dynasty to the Han Dynasty, there was a famous woman named Yan, and Zhang Yan was one of them.\" Luo Mi looked at me and said, \"Her life experience is very similar to the situation in your dream.\" \"I know.\" My voice was calm and clear, \"I started to guess it when I dreamed about Empress Lu. \"I looked up and smiled brightly, \"Don't forget, I checked so much information for this dream, how could I not have read \"Historical Records\" and \"Hanshu\"? \"I just felt that my heart was cold when I saw the last fate of the girl with the same name as me. Such a beautiful and lovely girl ended up with a miserable fate. Thousands of years later, due to special karmic connections, I feel the same way. At that moment, I stood there and felt the flying snow coming from outside. In an instant, I stood like a snowman. That night, I had my last dream. In the dream, there was heavy snow flying all over the sky. In the heavy snow, King Zhao Zhang Ao was imprisoned for some reason and escorted to Beijing. Princess Lu Yuan was running in the snow, wanting to see him off again. Countless eunuchs and officials stopped, persuaded, and respected her, but in her eyes, she still only saw the haggard and frustrated husband. King Zhao stopped and said something to Lu Yuan Xu Xu, his pity eyes passing over Lu Yuan's eight-month-old body. Finally gritted his teeth and ordered to move forward. Many lines of footprints were left on the outskirts of Handan. Lu Yuan stopped where he was and cried bitterly. Zhao Guoweng Zhang Yan raised his head and gathered up the cotton robe on his body while being escorted by his supervisor. Mrs. Zhu, the late king's wife, hugged her with concern. She raised her head in her grandmother's arms. Her formerly innocent and elegant face was now at a loss. Ayan. When I woke up, I just felt heartbroken. Sometimes the price to pay for growth is too huge. I pity that young child as much as I pity myself. \"Blind date?\" When I heard this scary term from Wan'er, I thought he was joking. \"Are you kidding me? I'm young, pretty, smart and capable. Why do we need to go on a blind date? You don't think I'm poor and you want to get rid of me, do you?\" \"How could that be?\" Wan'er tried hard to convince me, \"It's true that Manager Lu is very good. I'm here to catch you.\" Seize the opportunity.\" \"Really?\" I didn't dare to guess him with the most malicious intent, \"Don't you always say that he is a devil manager? Why are you saying good things about him now?\" \"In fact, he is not bad,\" smiled, \"and he is young and handsome and has a good career.He has a good personality, especially filial to his widowed mother. This time it was his mother who thought he was old enough to get married, so she considered the lazy method of blind date. As soon as the news came out, many people in the company were eager to introduce their sisters and daughters to him. If I hadn't relied on my superiority relationship, I wouldn't have been able to help you get a number. Anyway, it’s not like we’ll get married upon meeting. You can just go and have a look. At most, if you don’t like him, just ignore him. \"I touched my chin and said suspiciously, \"Then let's go see each other. \"I wanted to see what kind of good man Wan Er said he was. The place Wan Er decided to meet was a famous restaurant in the city. Because the nearby road was being repaired, the taxi dropped me off two streets away. When I got off the car, I suddenly remembered that I forgot to ask Wan Er. I couldn't help but laugh. There is no blind date that is more heartless than mine. I paid the money and stood up. Suddenly, an old woman on the crosswalk in front of me sprained her legs and fell to the ground. \"Hey. \"I exclaimed. A man in an iron-gray suit hurried over and helped the old lady to the roadside. I felt relieved and smacked my lips as I looked at the man. He was thin and had a gentle back. I lowered my head and snickered, thinking, if there is such a good man with a smile, At this level, my trip was worth it. Suddenly, the old lady being helped turned around and smiled at me. She looked like the old woman I met in Handan Cemetery. The car blew its horn and roared by, covering their figures in my heart. I was surprised and wanted to chase her, but I couldn't cross the road. I had to wait for a while. When the red light turned green again, the man in the iron gray suit put his hands in his suit pockets and left, going around the corner of the street. However, the old lady who should have been left there miraculously disappeared. Shadow. I hurriedly walked across the road, but I couldn't find her anywhere. Across the road, at the entrance of the garden in the middle of the street, an antique jewelry store stood there. A female clerk in antique clothes came to the door and shouted, \"Miss, do you want to come in and take a look?\" \"I nodded, pushed the door open and entered the store. The store was quiet, and there was no sign of anyone else. I was a little disappointed, and I had to think that I might have seen it wrong. However, the jewelry in this store was unexpectedly exquisite, and the thick luster seemed to be reflected from the time and space of a thousand years ago, especially the pair of blue earrings in the window, which were crystal clear. \"These earrings are very beautiful. The female shop assistant enthusiastically recommended, \"Young lady, let your husband see it. He will definitely like it.\" I thought she was joking, shook my head and said, \"I don't have a boyfriend yet.\" \"However, I looked down at myself, wearing a spring shirt and jeans, and it was rare for me to reflect. Is it too disrespectful to the man to go on a blind date like this? \"Okay. \"I looked at the earrings she was holding, and I really liked them. I reluctantly nodded, brushed my hair away and said, \"Pierce my ears.\" \"Uh,\" she burped, looking hesitant. \"Okay.\" \"The rice grains were gently rubbed on the lobe of my left ear, and the movements were slightly unfamiliar. Then, she said, \"Miss, I've pricked it.\" \"\"Um. \"I nodded absently. There was a sharp pain on my left earlobe. The female clerk apologized in panic in my ear, \"I'm sorry, I'm sorry. \"My head felt a little dizzy for no reason, and I subconsciously reached out to touch it. A drop of warm blood fell on my fingertips, as bright as a drop. This is all the chapters published in \"Golden House\" for trial reading. After it was published, it was added and deleted several times, and the number of words was compressed. The last paragraph may be a bit rough, and I will revise it in the future. After reading the preview chapter, some people were very cute, and some people asked me whether the brother and sister Wan Er and Yan Ran are like sisters or brothers. The 30th is coming. I wish you all good luck and prosperity in the new year. Recommended.",
